OL,3,GNEWSAMayor pledges to find cash for
OL,4,Aroad to university
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leading politician will explore ways
OL,7,Fof funding a new slip road off a busy
OL,8,Fdual-carriageway in Peterborough,
OL,9,Ffollowing a setback from government.
OL,11,FMinisters have revealed they will not
OL,12,Fhelp pay for the road off the A1139
OL,13,FFrank Perkins Parkway, which would
OL,14,Fserve as a more direct route to Anglia
OL,15,FRuskin University's campus in the city.
OL,17,FThe Mayor of Cambridgeshire and
OL,18,FPeterborough, Paul Bristow, said the
OL,19,Fneed for the road was "clear".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
